Notes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- modernc.org/sqlite is a pure-Go transpilation of SQLite. It is used instead
  of the CGO-based mattn/go-sqlite3 so that release binaries stay statically
  linked and cross-compile without a C toolchain.
- The Go standard library embeds the SQLite amalgamation headers under
  LICENSE and sqlite3.h; those are covered by the public-domain dedication in
  modernc.org/sqlite's BSD-3-Clause license.
- Transitive dependencies are not listed individually here. `go list -m all`
  enumerates the full module graph; the release workflow collects the license
  text of each one into THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/ and indexes them in
  THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.csv.
- To regenerate the direct list above after changing go.mod, run
  `go list -m -f '{{if not .Indirect}}{{.Path}} {{.Version}}{{end}}' all`
  and read each module's LICENSE from $(go env GOMODCACHE).
